;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="2514" width="500" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch4c52" value="&lt;b&gt;SKIN CARE / ZEUS&lt;/b&gt;: 383 columns, 22 named parts, 10 spare&lt;br&gt;ZAC - BCM -&gt; ZAC-Bottle dispenser&lt;br&gt;ZAC - SERAC -&gt; ZAC-Filling machine&lt;br&gt;ZAC - BOL POMPES -&gt; ZAC-Pumps dispenser&lt;br&gt;ZAC - BOL CAPS -&gt; ZAC-Caps dispenser&lt;br&gt;ZAC - REJVES -&gt; ZAC-Capping/Screwing machine&lt;br&gt;ZAC - Process -&gt; ZAC-Process&lt;br&gt;ZAC - Autres -&gt; ZAC-Other&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC DOMINO LASER -&gt; EXT-Laser&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC CAMÉRA -&gt; EXT-Camera&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC KOSME -&gt; EXT-Bottle labeller&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC KOSME (Film Cassé) -&gt; EXT-Bottle labeller&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC KOSME (Bourrage sortie étoile) -&gt; EXT-Bottle labeller&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC Formeuse Barquette -&gt; EXT-Case packer part1&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC AN -&gt; EXT-Case packer part2&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC AN (Flacon tombé dans le bac) -&gt; EXT-Case packer part2&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC AN (Problème Vis décalée) -&gt; EXT-Case packer part2&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC Coiffeuse -&gt; EXT-Case packer part3&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC Bourrage Sortie Coiffeuse -&gt; EXT-Case packer part3&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC GARVENS Caisse -&gt; EXT-Weighter&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC DOMINO Étiquette -&gt; EXT-Case labeller&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC FANUC -&gt; EXT-Paletizer&lt;br&gt;Ext ZAC Autres -&gt; EXT-Other" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="2514" width="500" height="370" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="5 Base to Plan_OPT_EU" id="chartres5"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="ch5c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Base -&amp;gt; Plan_OPT_EU (one row per day, shift and product slot)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Grain: for each day, each of the 5 shift types x 4 product slots that holds a Code, Volume or Temps becomes one row. The macro rule of the PlanOPT sheet is reproduced where it was checked on the files. Target columns and examples follow the EU extract (diagrams/data/eu-extract-profile.json).&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1500" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c3" value="&lt;b&gt;FROM BASE, CHECKED ON THE FILES&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="230" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c4" value="&lt;b&gt;FIXED VALUE OR LOOKUP (CONFIG)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="90" width="230" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c5" value="&lt;b&gt;RULE TO CONFIRM&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="90" width="230" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c6" value="&lt;b&gt;NO SOURCE IN THE CHARTRES FILES&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="90" width="230" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Base row of the day&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ANNEE, MOIS, JOUR + 20 product slots (ET to LQ)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c8" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 1: keep filled slots&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;shift = Semaine Matin ... Weekend Nuit, slot PF1 to PF4" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c9" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ch5c7" target="ch5c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c10" value="&lt;b&gt;Plan_OPT_EU row&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;one per filled slot (IWKA 2 on 23 Oct: 5 rows)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c11" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ch5c8" target="ch5c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ch5c12" value="&lt;b&gt;Target column&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dddddd;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="250" width="190" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id=